# ALLOW-LIST (RULEBOOK §18): the build context holds only what apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile need.
# Everything else (.env*, keys/certs, infra/, scripts/, docs/, reference/, loadtests/, backups/, .git, CLAUDE.md) stays out.
# A new root-level file a build needs (e.g. .npmrc, patches/) must be allowed here explicitly.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!tsconfig.base.json
# Tailwind v4 source detection honours .gitignore; it holds no secrets.
!.gitignore
!apps/api
!apps/web
!packages

# Re-excluded inside the allowed trees (the last matching rule wins).
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/.turbo
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/Dockerfile
**/*.dockerignore
# Dev/test-only code never enters an image (docs/DECISIONS.md 2026-10-30 A1 #4).
apps/api/prisma/fixtures
apps/api/test
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
# Secrets, wherever they appear.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.envrc
**/.npmrc
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.crt
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.dump
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/certs
**/secrets
